      "text": "ive understoof the fundamentals of sqlite3. lets move on to importing and processing data from .txt and .csv files just like in the exams. is this supposed to be done in the jupyter notebok environment or the IDLE environment? give a step by step on how to run it if it is done on the jupyter notebook env",
      "role": "user",
